OL,3,GNEWSA'It was hard to adjust after
OL,4,Asleeping rough'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who slept rough in Manchester for
OL,7,Fa year has said it was hard to adjust
OL,8,Fto sleeping in his own room after
OL,9,Ffinally finding accommodation, as Andy
OL,10,FBurnham  unveiled a plan to get rough
OL,11,Fsleepers off the streets this winter.
OL,13,FBen (not his real name) said homeless
OL,14,Fpeople would need a lot of support if
OL,15,Fthe prime minister's vision "to get
OL,16,Feveryone in for Christmas" was to
OL,17,Fsucceed.
OL,19,F"I've heard of people who did not sleep
OL,20,Fin a bed for months even when they got
OL,21,Ftheir own place and I can see why," he
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
